  "body": "Some waterfront homes offer a view. This one puts the water at the centre of how you live.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the edge of Gulf Harbour, 579A Laurie Southwick Parade presents an exceptional opportunity to secure a substantial 281m² waterfront residence, complete with its own private 14-metre marina berth.\r\n\r\nOffered for sale for the first time since being purchased brand new, this impressive home combines generous proportions, effortless living and an exceptional boating lifestyle.\r\n\r\nExpansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas flow seamlessly outdoors towards the marina. Upstairs, the oversized primary suite features a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and private balcony, while additional bedrooms provide excellent separation for family and guests.\r\n\r\nA large recreation room opens onto another waterfront-facing balcony, while a dedicated office, additional flexible room, internal lift and double internal-access garage complete this exceptional residence.\r\n\r\nThe standout feature is undoubtedly the private 14-metre marina berth, capable of accommodating a substantially larger vessel than many smaller berths along the waterfront. Your boat is just moments from home, with the Hauraki Gulf waiting beyond.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n- Approximately 281m² of waterfront living\r\n- Private 14-metre marina berth\r\n- Expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Multiple waterfront-facing balconies\r\n- Oversized primary suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n- Large recreation room / second living\r\n- Dedicated office plus flexible additional room\r\n- Internal lift\r\n- Double internal-access garage\r\n- Vendor's boat potentially available by separate negotiation\r\n\r\nAn Opportunity Difficult to Replicate\r\n\r\nWaterfront residences of this scale are rarely available, particularly those combining a substantial private marina berth, internal lift and generous living spaces.\r\n\r\nWith the property now offered at a clear asking price, buyers have the opportunity to secure a unique waterfront lifestyle without waiting for another to become available.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
